.SS "int rubber_set (\fBicon_list\fP * il, int x1, int y1, int x2, int y2)"
.PP
update rubber-band to encompass given coordinates. 
.PP
the coordinates are guaranteed to be in order, ie, x1<=x2 ^ y1<=y2. 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
an error-code 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIil\fP - the icon-list we're selecting in 
.br
\fIx1\fP - left boundary 
.br
\fIy1\fP - upper boundary 
.br
\fIx2\fP - right boundary 
.br
\fIy2\fP - lower boundary
.RE
.PP

